<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Jona</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jona</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jona</para>
  <para style="mt">Jona</para>
  <para style="ip">Jonah thrown overboard <figure style="fig" alt="Jonah thrown overboard" file="FM 119 Jonah Thrown Overboard_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1" />
  <para style="s">God ere mogl, Jona ede pi Ninive yoba meglmara pidre, ye kamo di tenabedi dedugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jonah Route" file="Map_Jona_Kuman.jpg" size="span" copy="FMOsoft" ref="1.1" />Yagl ta moglkwa kagie Jona we digwa. Te, Jona nem kagie Amitai we digwa. Ana aglke ta Yawe ere mogl, Jona di te, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="JON 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2" />Yoba taun kade Ninive we dimara meglkwa we, ye mabuno kide kaima beglko, kaniga. Yegl pre ene ede pi dumo Ninive i pidre, Ninive yoba ka inaiglkwa i, ye di tenatniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JON 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3" />Yawe yegl dugwa ba Jona ere mogl, Yawe moglmara kide kodinagledi teke ede pi dumo Tarsis we dimara i, enagledi prukwa. Yegl prisre, ye dumo kebra ta Jopa we dimara, mudi nigl bina yogwa i pidre, sip ta ede Tarsis enabuka doko kandre, topo tedre, Yawe moglmara kide kodo, sip i mina teke ede enagledi ede sip bolamugl pi moglkwa.<verse eid="JON 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4" />Ana Jona yegl ere, sip i mina ede ogwa ba Yawe ere mogl, ir waga podo ta dedugo, ugwa. Ir waga podo ugo, mudi nigl si pepigl di, si tobuno yake togo, sip buko dinagledi erukwa. <verse eid="JON 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5" />Yegl eruko, yagl sip wagle kogon erikwa i, ye kudugl podo goglsre, ye swara swarade god pere pere kamage ere teigwa i, ye no ere inaiglmedi agle di prisre, sip yubun dekrabedi bonagana pia si nigle edigwa. Yegl erikwa ba Jona we, ye sip yugugl mogl, ugl du paugwa. <verse eid="JON 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6" />Ugl du paugwa pre sip sugl moglkwa yagl i ye moglmara udre, uglo yokidre, ye ka te, yegl dugwa, Siragl eruko, ene ugl pane? Ene ugl paikre, godnen agle di pro! Ye nono mitno ta goran, nono ta goglkramniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JON 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7" />Ana yagl sip mina kogon erikwa i we, yene di iboria ede, yegl digwa, Nono yoba ira aglau eruko, ir waga podo ugwa i doko kanamga pre kobuglo pere pere mak si yedre, swara ta gudu i meda ede kanamga. Yoba ta kobuglomo kanamga i, aglau erumedi pramniwe di, yegl digwa. Yegl didre, ye dimere yegl ersre, Jona kobuglomo kanigwa. <verse eid="JON 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8" />Ye Jona kobuglomo kandre, Jona yegl di prikwa, No yubun podo yumga i, ira aglau erume? digwa. Ene kogon siragl mere ere motnga ya te, dumo aglo nem motnga ya te, siragl yugobuno mina motnga i, di noro! di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="JON 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9" />Ana yagl sip mina kogon erikwa i yegl digo, Jona di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na Hibru yagl moglsre, Yawe kuduglmo goglsre, kamage ere teiga. Yawe ye God heven ibo moglsre, mudi nigl ya dumo makan ere yome dugwa. <verse eid="JON 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10" />Ye yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Na Yawe moglmara kide kodinagledi teke ede wiwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye kudugl podo goglsre, Jona di pre, Ene siragl pre etne? di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="JON 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11" />Ana mudi nigl we, si pepigl di, si tobuno yake te, podo kaima eruko, yagl sip mina kogon erikwa i ere mogl, Jona yegl di prikwa, No ene siragl ere tomun, mudi nigl konade morabe? digwa. <verse eid="JON 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12" />Yegl digo, Jona di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Nono yubun podo erme yumga i, na mabuno moledi prika. Yegl pre ene na pia si mudi nigl atne edibi, mudi nigl aglke kor konade morabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JON 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13" />Ana Jona yegl dugwa ba yagl i ye dumere erekre, yobuglo ere, ede mudi nigl bina enamnedi buglo aware mina nigl aware si ida edigo, manugwa. Mudi nigl podo kide kaima si pepigl di, si tobuno yake togwa pre kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="JON 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14" />Kuno erekruko, ye Yawe agle di, yegl digwa, Yawe yo, no yagl i pia si nigl atne edemun, ene ere kide ere ikne ede noragledi no si goglkro! Yoba swara ta aglau erekruko, yoba ta ere mogl, ye si goglko, ene ka tage tenere yegl ta ere norokratniwa. Enene pitnere ere edingo, taragl i plau dugwa pre dumniwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="JON 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15" />Yegl didre, ye Jona boglo ere, pia si nigl atne edigo, ir waga dudugo, mudi nigl konade moglkwa. <verse eid="JON 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16" />Yegl eruko, yagl sip mina kogon erikwa i, Yawe kuduglmo podo goglsre, tawa tedre, ye taragl tau ama Yawe tenamnedi ka gigledi di teigwa.<verse eid="JON 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JON 1:17" />Ana ye Jona pia si nigl atne edigo, ye ede atne ogo, Yawe buglo bagle podo ta dedugo, buglo bagle i u Jona pemgo edugwa. Pemgo edugo, Jona ege suota etne ya eduer buglo bagle dane wagle pai moglkwa.<verse eid="JON 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2" />
  <para style="s">Jona God kamage ere togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1" />Jona buglo bagle dane wagle pai moglsre, Yawe, ye Godmo moglkwa i, kamage ere togwa. <verse eid="JON 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2" />Ye yegl dugwa, Yawe yo, na yubun podo idre, na ene agle digo, ene na ake ple di natnga. Na ede atne kaima pi, yoba geglkwa pai meglmara mere yegl eiga ba ene na agle diga i prisre, na ake ple di natnga. <verse eid="JON 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3" />Ene ere mogl, yoba na pia si nigl atne edinaiglmedi etnga. Erse, ene ama nigl si pepigl di, na i yobugl suna edidre, na i atne edenabedi etnga. Etngo, na nigl atne kaima eiga. <verse eid="JON 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4" />Na nigl atne kaima pi, nomana wagle ene yegl di teiga, Ene ere mogl, na ene motnara si pi eglke edinga. Edinga ba na aglke kor yugunen i pere edinga yomara i kan enagle diga. <verse eid="JON 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5" />Na nigl atne kaima pidre, goraglka magigl erukwa. Mudi nigl na i atne edugo, nigle kugl kan na bitna yobuglkwa. <verse eid="JON 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6" />Na ede atne eiga i, makan muglo yei, ede nigl atne ime eimara mabunomugl pidre, dumo ta aimadi panaglka mere yegl moglka. Na yoba geglkwa pai meglmara mere yegl moglka ba Yawe, ene na Godna motnga i, ene na kor morabedi na i kor edidre, i ede egli uniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JON 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7" />Jona ka yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Yawe yo, na goragledi ere, ene poglo di prisre, kamage ere teiga. Kamage ere teigo, na kana ede pi ene yugunen i pere edinga i yugugl motnara ogo, ene pitnga. <verse eid="JON 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8" />Yoba ere mogl, god kibi, kogon swara ta erekrikwa godno i, ye bekidre, kamage ere teigwa i, ene ye ere wakai ere tenatnga ba ye ta ikraiglkwa. <verse eid="JON 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9" />Ba na we, na ene wakai we di tenagledi giglage didre, ene tawa tenaglka. Na yegl eragledi ene ka giglede di te padiglka i, na dimere eragle dugwa. Ene swara yoba ere inga motniwe di, Jona yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JON 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10" />Ana Yawe we, ye ere mogl, buglo bagle i di togo, buglo bagle ede nigle bina pi, Jona mebigl si makan mina edugwa.<verse eid="JON 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3" />
  <para style="s">Jona ede dumo Ninive we dimara ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1" />Ana buglo bagle Jona mebigl si meda makan mina edugo, Yawe aglke kor Jona di te, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="JON 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2" />Ene ede pi dumo podo Ninive we dimara pidre, na ka siragl mere ta ene di tenaglka i, Ninive yoba di tenatniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JON 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3" />Yegl dugo, Jona ye dumere ede dumo Ninive ogwa. Ana Ninive we, dumo podo kide yogwa. Yoba ta dumo mudu kanabuka i, ege suota wan winabo di mogl, kanabuka. <verse eid="JON 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4" />Ana Jona ede dumo Ninive pi plau didre, ege swara ta konbauna wan ede suna pi, Ninive yoba agle didre, yegl di togwa, Yawe ege 40-pela de mogl, Nineve ere kide ere kodinabiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JON 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5" />Yegl dugo, Ninive yoba God kamo i pre mediglsre, ye yoba kade meglkwa ya yoko meglkwa i mudu tadaglme eunedi prikwa i, i nogugl edinamnedi kaya mokna mawagl ersre, lap gagle yaglkwa prikwa.<verse eid="JON 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6" />Ana Ninive yoba yegl eriko, Ninive king we, ye Jona kamo prukwa igne ye siamo king kide kodo, gagl suna olto edugwa i, gugl ede, lap gagle yaglkwa prisre, ye yugum pere edimara bolamugl ame di moglkwa. <verse eid="JON 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7" />Ame di moglko, ye yobamo kade bogl ka di padiglsre, yoba tau Ninive yoba di tenaiglmedi dedigo, ye pi, yoba mudu yegl di teigwa, Nono kingno yobamo kade bogl we, yegl digwa, Ninive yoba ya te, ye kau ya meme ya sipsip kiglkwa i ya te, aglno buglano mudu kaya mokna mawagl ere, nigl pra ta nekraiglkwa. <verse eid="JON 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8" />Nekribi, yoba mudu lap gagle yaglkwa prisre, aglno buglano ama lap gagle yaglkwa were tedre, eraiglkwa. Te, ene mudu God agle didre, kamage giglede ere teo! Ene mabuno kide erikwa i kide kodo, kuda beglkwa i ama kide kodo, yegl erio! <verse eid="JON 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9" />Nono yegl eun, God no sinabo mo no sikrabo mo i ta kiurumga. God nono mitno ta goglsre, dem kubrukwa kide kodinan, nono ta goglkramniwe di, king yaglmo kade bogl yegl dime digwa.<verse eid="JON 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10" />Ana ka yegl digo, Ninive yoba ye mabunono kide beglkwa i, kide kodigo, God kanugwa. God kandre, ye ere kide ere tenagle dugwa i, kide kodidre, erekrukwa.<verse eid="JON 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4" />
  <para style="s">God Ninive yoba mitno goglkwa ba Jona dem kubrukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1" />Ana Yawe Ninive ere kide erekrukwa i, Jona kide prisre, dem kubrukwa. <verse eid="JON 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2" />Dem kubrisre, ye Yawe kamage ere te, yegl dugwa, Yawe yo, na okna yugunamugl moglka igne, Yawe ye mitno goglsre, ere kide ere tekrabiwe diga. Na pre kan erika i, ene God yoba mitno goglsre, ye ere kide ere tenatnara aglke ere wakai ere tenga motnga. Ene den oglade kubrokre, den mudn ka kaima yoba tedre, ye ere kide ere tenatnga i kide kodinga. Mabuno i pre na teke ede dumo Tarsis we dimara enagledi eiga. <verse eid="JON 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3" />Yegl pre Yawe yo, na na si goglo! Na kor moraglka kide prika. Goraglka wakai priwe di, Jona yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JON 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4" />Jona ka yegl dugo, Yawe di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene den kubutnga i, wakai pamo? dugwa.<verse eid="JON 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5" />Ana Jona ere mogl, dumo Ninive kide kodo, kuri ta ede ade umara kra pi, taun bina yugu teka ta sidre, bogume yomara atne ame dugwa. Ye siragl taragl dumo Ninive plau dinabuka i kanagledi atne ame di moglkwa. <verse eid="JON 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6" />Jona ame di moglko, ade dogwa pre Yawe God ere mogl, Jona ake ple dinagledi dr ta moginabedi ere edugo, mogo ede mitna pi, bogume togwa. Bogume togo, Jona dr i kandre, gun podo yogwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Jonah under vine" file="co01422b.TIF" size="col" loc="4.6" copy="David C. Cook" ref="4.6" /> <verse eid="JON 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7" />Gun podo yogwa ba tagugo i we, tagna kana, God kabo ta dr kane kigle keglu sinabedi ere edugo, kigle keglu sugwa. Kigle keglu sugo, dr kane ake yamunugo, goglkwa. <verse eid="JON 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8" />Yegl eruko, ade sugo, God ir niga dugwa ta ade umara mogl unabedi dedugo, ugwa. Ugo, Jona bre ade dedre, gumuglo magruko, ye goragledi prisre, yegl dugwa, Na goraglka, wakai prika. Kor moraglka, kide prie di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JON 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9" />Jona ka yegl dugo, God ere mogl, Jona yegl di prukwa, Dr goglkwa i pre ene den kubutnga i, wakai pamo? dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jona di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na mabuno pamara dena kubrika. Na dena kubrisre, goraglka, kuno erumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JON 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10" />Yegl dugo, Yawe aglke kor dugwa, Dr i, ege swara mina pare yaudo sidre, ege swara mina goglkwa. Te, ene kogon etngo, ta pare yaudo sikrukwa. Yegl erukwa ba ene dr mirie goglnga. <verse eid="JON 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11" />Ana Ninive yoba we, na ye mitno goglkraglo? Ninive dumo podo yogwa. Yoba Ninive moglsre, mabuno wakai ya mabuno kide pre pogl sikrikwa i, 120,000 mogl ede mitna eigo, agl bugla ama mere kide meglkwa. I pre na mitno goglkrabedi pitno? di, Yawe yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JON 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4" />
</usx>